==Trivia==
[[File:TCGP Cover Garden of Smiling Flowers.png|thumb|left|"Garden of Smiling Flowers" binder cover]]
This card's illustration is part of a {{TCG|combined illustration}} along with {{TCG ID|Space-Time Smackdown|Tangela|4}}, {{TCG ID|Space-Time Smackdown|Shaymin|22}}, and {{TCG ID|Space-Time Smackdown|Togepi|63}} from the same expansion. Together, these cards form the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion's "Garden of Smiling Flowers" [[Space-Time Smackdown (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]]. A second collection—the "Garden of Smiling Flowers 2" secret mission—was added to the game on June 26, 2025; the completion reward for this is the "Garden of Smiling Flowers" binder cover, showcasing the full illustration.

===Origin===
*{{m|Splash}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Buneary}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

